    <Placemark>
      <name>⚠ Lake Billy Chinook</name>
      <styleUrl>#pt_restricted</styleUrl>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Lake Billy Chinook</b><br/>Jefferson, Central<br/>Power boats allowed &mdash; seaplane-capable.<br/>Motor use: Default: motors allowed unless a rule below applies<br/><br/><b>&#9888; Oregon boating rules on this waterway</b><br/><b>All Boats Prohibited</b>: Lake Billy Chinook: no boats - Upper Deschutes swim area<br/>All boats prohibited within marked swim area<br/><a href="https://www.oregonlegislature.gov/bills_laws/ors/ors830.html">Oregon OAR rule</a><br/><b>All Boats Prohibited</b>: Lake Billy Chinook: no boats - Round Butte Dam exclusion area<br/>All boats prohibited inside the log boom enclosure around Round Butte Dam<br/><a href="https://secure.sos.state.or.us/oard/view.action?ruleNumber=250-020-0161 ">Oregon OAR rule</a><br/><b>All Boats Prohibited</b>: Lake Billy Chinook: no boats - Lower Deschutes swim area<br/>All boats prohibited within marked swim area<br/><a href="https://www.oregonlegislature.gov/bills_laws/ors/ors830.html">Oregon OAR rule</a><br/><b>All Boats Prohibited</b>: Lake Billy Chinook: no boats - Crooked River swim area<br/>All boats prohibited within marked swim area<br/><a href="https://www.oregonlegislature.gov/bills_laws/ors/ors830.html">Oregon OAR rule</a>]]></description>
