    <Placemark>
      <name>⚠ Lake Simtustus</name>
      <styleUrl>#pt_restricted</styleUrl>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Lake Simtustus</b><br/>Jefferson, Central<br/>Power boats allowed &mdash; seaplane-capable.<br/>Motor use: Default: motors allowed unless a rule below applies<br/><br/><b>&#9888; Oregon boating rules on this waterway</b><br/><b>All Boats Prohibited</b>: Lake Simtustus: no boats - Round Butte Dam tailrace exlusion area<br/>All boats prohibited within the restricted tailrace area enclosed by the log boom approximately 1200 feet down-stream of Round Butte Dam<br/><a href="https://secure.sos.state.or.us/oard/view.action?ruleNumber=250-020-0161 ">Oregon OAR rule</a><br/><b>All Boats Prohibited</b>: Lake Simtustus: no boats - Pelton Dam exclusion area<br/>All boats prohibited within the restricted intake area enclosed by the log boom located approximately 200 feet upstream of Pelton Dam<br/><a href="https://secure.sos.state.or.us/oard/view.action?ruleNumber=250-020-0161 ">Oregon OAR rule</a>]]></description>
