    <Placemark>
      <name>⚠ South Santiam River</name>
      <styleUrl>#pt_restricted</styleUrl>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>South Santiam River</b><br/>Linn, Willamette<br/>Power boats allowed &mdash; seaplane-capable.<br/>Motor use: Default: motors allowed unless a rule below applies<br/><br/><b>&#9888; Oregon boating rules on this waterway</b><br/><b>Motor Restriction</b>: South Santiam River: no jet pump drives<br/>No jet pump drives upstream of the Lebanon Dam<br/><a href="https://secure.sos.state.or.us/oard/view.action?ruleNumber=250-020-0240">Oregon OAR rule</a>]]></description>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>-122.84125,44.52573,0</coordinates>
      </Point>
