    <Placemark>
      <name>⚠ South Twin Lake</name>
      <styleUrl>#pt_restricted</styleUrl>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>South Twin Lake</b><br/>Deschutes, Central<br/>Power boats allowed &mdash; seaplane-capable.<br/>Motor use: Default: motors allowed unless a rule below applies<br/><br/><b>&#9888; Oregon boating rules on this waterway</b><br/><b>Motor Restriction</b>: South Twin Lake: no motors<br/>A person must not use a motor to propel a boat unless the motor is electric, the boat is not operated in excess of slow-no wake speed, and the operator of the boat has a disability or operates the boat on behalf of a passenger who has a disability.<br/><a href="https://secure.sos.state.or.us/oard/view.action?ruleNumber=250-020-0091">Oregon OAR rule</a>]]></description>
