      <name>⚠ Waldo Lake</name>
      <styleUrl>#pt_restricted</styleUrl>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Waldo Lake</b><br/>Lane, Willamette<br/>Power boats allowed &mdash; seaplane-capable.<br/>Motor use: Default: motors allowed unless a rule below applies<br/><br/><b>&#9888; Oregon boating rules on this waterway</b><br/><b>Motor Restriction</b>: Waldo Lake: electric motors only<br/>Electric motors only, 10 mph limit (entire lake)<br/><a href="https://www.oregonlegislature.gov/bills_laws/ors/ors830.html">Oregon OAR rule</a>]]></description>
