      <description><![CDATA[<b>Alsea River</b><br/>Lincoln, Northwest<br/>Power boats allowed &mdash; seaplane-capable.<br/>Motor use: Default: motors allowed unless a rule below applies<br/><br/><b>&#9888; Oregon boating rules on this waterway</b><br/><b>Motor Restriction</b>: Alsea River: no jet pump drives<br/>No jet pump drives upstream of Hatchery Creek (approximate RM 12)<br/><a href="https://secure.sos.state.or.us/oard/view.action?ruleNumber=250-020-0231">Oregon OAR rule</a>]]></description>
